  24	/// The bounds of the selection.
  25	bounds: Bounds,
  26	
  27	/// Whether or not this selection refers to a rectangle, rather than whole
  28	/// lines of a buffer. In this mode, start and end refer to the top left and
  29	/// bottom right of the rectangle, or vice versa if the selection is backwards.
